OL,3,GNEWSAOasis fans hope for Celtic Park
OL,4,Agigs after cracking clues in chip shop
OL,5,Avideo
OL,6,
OL,7,FOasis fans have uncovered a set of
OL,8,Fcryptic clues in a promo video from the
OL,9,Fband, suggesting that they will stage
OL,10,Fgigs at Celtic Park in Glasgow next
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FThe Manchester rockers released the
OL,14,F23-second teaser on their social media
OL,15,Faccounts, showing two boys in what
OL,16,Fappears to be a Scottish chip shop.
OL,18,FInternet sleuths spotted sets of
OL,19,Fnumbers in posters around the chippy
OL,20,Fwhich they worked out to be the map
OL,21,Fco-ordinates for Celtic's Parkhead
OL,22,Fstadium.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
